// matchRunningDesktopAccounts 把批量进程扫描结果映射回账号：
// 逐账号算出与启动器一致的 desktop user-data 目录，命中即视为该账号桌面运行中。

function matchRunningDesktopAccounts(ctx, instances) {
  return Object.keys(matchRunningDesktopAccountPids(ctx, instances));
}

function matchRunningDesktopAccountPids(ctx, instances) {
  if (!Array.isArray(instances) || instances.length === 0) return {};
  const isWindows = resolveClientPlatform({
    processObj: ctx.processObj || ctx.deps && ctx.deps.processObj || process
  }) === CLIENT_PLATFORMS.WINDOWS;
  const normalizeDir = (value) => {
    const text = String(value || '').trim();
    return isWindows ? text.toLowerCase() : text;
  };
  const runningDirs = new Set(instances
    .map((instance) => normalizeDir(instance && instance.userDataDir))
    .filter(Boolean));
  if (runningDirs.size === 0) return {};

  const aiHomeDir = resolveAiHomeDir(ctx);
  const records = listAccountRefRecords(ctx.fs, aiHomeDir, '', { bestEffort: true });
  const running = {};
  for (const record of Array.isArray(records) ? records : []) {
    const provider = String(record.provider || '').trim().toLowerCase();
    const accountRef = String(record.accountRef || '').trim();
    if (!provider || !accountRef) continue;
    const cliConfig = getProviderCLIConfig(provider);
    const definition = getProviderDefinition(provider);
    if (!cliConfig || !cliConfig.desktopClient || !definition || !definition.clients || !definition.clients.desktop) continue;
    const profileDir = typeof ctx.getProfileDir === 'function'
      ? String(ctx.getProfileDir(provider, accountRef) || '').trim()
      : resolveAccountRuntimeDir(aiHomeDir, provider, accountRef);
    if (!profileDir) continue;
    const userDataDir = normalizeDir(path.join(profileDir, 'electron-user-data'));
    if (runningDirs.has(userDataDir)) {
      const pids = instances
        .filter((instance) => normalizeDir(instance && instance.userDataDir) === userDataDir)
        .map((instance) => Number(instance && instance.pid))
        .filter((pid) => Number.isFinite(pid) && pid > 0);
      running[accountRef] = Array.from(new Set(pids));
    }
  }
  return running;
}

function matchRunningCliAccountPids(ctx, instances) {
  if (!Array.isArray(instances) || instances.length === 0) return {};
  const records = listCliAccountRefRecords(ctx.fs, resolveAiHomeDir(ctx), '', { bestEffort: true });
  const bySlot = new Map((Array.isArray(records) ? records : []).map((record) => [
    `${String(record.provider || '').trim().toLowerCase()}\u0000${String(record.cliAccountId || '').trim()}`,
    String(record.accountRef || '').trim()
  ]));
  const running = {};
  for (const instance of instances) {
    const provider = String(instance && instance.provider || '').trim().toLowerCase();
    const cliAccountId = String(instance && instance.cliAccountId || '').trim();
    const markerRef = String(instance && instance.accountRef || '').trim();
    const accountRef = markerRef || bySlot.get(`${provider}\u0000${cliAccountId}`) || '';
    const pid = Number(instance && instance.pid);
    if (!accountRef || !Number.isFinite(pid) || pid <= 0) continue;
    if (!running[accountRef]) running[accountRef] = [];
    if (!running[accountRef].includes(pid)) running[accountRef].push(pid);
  }
  return running;
}

function matchRunningCliAccounts(ctx, instances) {
  return Object.keys(matchRunningCliAccountPids(ctx, instances));
}

